  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical and Logistical Assistance for the Organisation of the Policy Forum on Development (2021-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To assist the European Commission in facilitating spaces for dialogue and consultations at global and regional level with civil society networks, associations of local authorities and EU institutions and Member States, mainly through the Policy Forum on Development (PFD), and ad hoc consultations. To support the European Commission in the drafting of regular updates on policy issues related to and raised by CSO/ALA and to contribute in background papers.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
